Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 09:33:10 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] Custom Match rooms: LM LoadRoom (418) / RegisterRoom
 (419) handlers and room registry

The Live Monitor's Custom Match room search sent LoadRoom and got ErrServer
"Unhandled case", so it showed "this card cannot be used".

- LoadRoom: card lookup by access code + chip id (unknown card -> ErrServer as
  before); Success with load_room {pilot_id, is_new_card, rooms, status 0,
  acid_error ACID_SUCCESS}; rooms the card joined today (empty list is valid).
- RegisterRoom: records the pilot's pick for today; status 0 / 1.
- CustomRoomStore: room code, owner, members, world, end-of-day expiry, JSON
  state, wire pilot ids only, codes logged masked. Served at /tag/rooms on the
  matchmaker (existing /tag secret / LAN guard); card servers use HTTP or the
  in-process store (CustomRooms.LocalStore).
- PreLoadCard.matching_tag with world_id for today's pick, behind
  CustomRooms.SendMatchingTag (default off, experimental).
- 20 unit tests (513 total), CUSTOM_ROOMS.md design notes.

Co-authored-by: Grok Bot <grok-bot@users.noreply.github.com>
