From bd3993872d2b34c472d5c79114ff9c12e5d4a700 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ServerOmega <69215510+ServerOmega@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 09:47:31 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/6] Fix LoadRoom reply so the LM lists custom rooms
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The LM Custom Match search showed "このカードは使用できません" for both
an empty list and a test room, even though LoadRoom returned HTTP 200.
vsac29 CAcSeqLmCustomMatch's callback (0x1408e7970) only accepts
load_room.status == 1; status 0 is remapped to NOTUSE. After that, the
WaitResponse filter (0x1408bd204) keeps tag_type 2 (list) or 4 (special
slot) and skips 1 and 3, comparing start/end dates as Unix seconds.

- LoadRoom status is now 1 (RegisterRoom status 0 is unchanged).
- RoomGroup.tag_type 1 (legacy default) and unknown values are emitted
  as 2 so existing rooms show up; 2 and 4 are passed through.
- 21 CustomRoom unit tests.

Co-authored-by: Grok Bot <grok-bot@users.noreply.github.com>
