+# Official VS.Mobile Custom Match rooms vs our implementation
+
+Research only (2026-11-17, America/Los_Angeles). No deploys, no pushes, no PC/VPS changes. Compared against `CUSTOM_ROOM_OPTIONS.md` and the Rooms web UI in this worktree (`WebUIInfinite/Client/Pages/Rooms.razor`, `RoomsRequests.cs`, `CustomRoomStore`).
+
+**Confidence:** H = official page or a screenshot of the live VS.Mobile form, M = contemporary player guide that cites official help and the author's own create-room screen, L = wiki / older-title official page / inference. Uncertain items are marked; nothing below is invented to fill a gap.
+
+This answers whether the official **ガンダムVS.モバイル** (VS.Mobile) site was used as a reference. The earlier options write-up was from the vsac29 LM/cab binary and our server fields only. Official IB help is still live on `web.vsmobile.jp` and disagrees with several of our labels, ranges, and missing form controls.
+
+---
+
