+## 2. How official Custom Match works (IB)
+
+Two room kinds, plus a later event/tournament slot:
+
+* **パブリックルーム** — official, recurring, solo-only custom rooms. Players do not create these. Join from VS.Mobile or the live monitor / "カスタムマッチ検索". Requires **50 or more Class Match G battles** (solo + team combined). Hours from news #16 (M, page itself 403 this turn): weekdays **10:00–18:00**, weekends and holidays **10:00–14:00**. Help page (H): “様々なルールでのカスタムマッチが定期的に開催されています.” IB wiki (L) adds that hours vary by day and that rooms may be split by class band (P+V vs A+Ex) — unofficial, marked with “？”.
+* **プライベートルーム** — a player (paid member) sets the rules and hosts. This is the create-room flow our web UI is standing in for.
+* **イベントルーム / VS.オンライン大会** — official arcade site and IB wiki: event-only rooms; tournaments need pre-entry and awards, and take priority over custom match while entered (blog, from the VS.Mobile custom-match notice).
+
+**Who can create / join (H, create + join help, card_mobile page):**
+
+* Create: paid VS.Mobile members only, **15 rooms per calendar month**, counter resets at **00:00 on the 1st** (IB help; XB official page said 04:00 — IB text wins).
+* The creator is **ルームマスター** and can approve join requests and dismiss the room.
+* Join: free members allowed, via **ルーム検索** or **ルーム招待コード**. Participants may share the invite code with external tools.
+* If the room is “承認あり”, the master must approve or the player cannot join.
+* Dissolving a room does **not** refund the monthly create count (blog, citing official dismiss help, M). If the master unregisters the card or leaves the service, the room is dismissed and members are marked as left (blog, M).
+
+**How players actually play (H, matching help + official arcade online page):**
+
+1. Join the room on VS.Mobile or by touching a card on a live monitor that is searching custom rooms.
+2. When the room's valid window starts, start an online match on a cab that can play online.
+3. Choose the **same sortie type** as the room (ソロ出撃 / チーム出撃). Mix rooms exist; the official site also says **ミックスマッチ cannot be selected while you are already in a custom room**. IB wiki (L): after joining, the versus menu replaces ミックスマッチ with カスタムマッチ.
+4. While “カスタムマッチで検索中” is shown, matching is among room members only.
+
+Custom matching is **disabled** and ordinary online matching is used instead when (H, matching help):
+
+* the room has fewer than **4** members
+* enough players for a bout do not show up within a time limit (a win in ordinary matching restarts matching)
+* オンラインイベント杯 is selected
+* sortie type does not match the room (solo room + team sortie, or team room + solo sortie)
+* in a team room, the partner is in a **different** room
+* the cab/line is not set up for online play
+* plus: unstable network; players in the **same shop** must start on cabs attached to the **same live monitor**
+
+**Invite / room code (H / M):**
+
+* Official name: **ルーム招待コード**. Shown on the VS.Mobile room page (and, in XB official / OB wiki, on the cab card-confirm / login screen, top right, once the room is active).
+* Join by typing the code under プライベート → ルーム参加, or find a room that was created with “ルーム検索に公開する” = 公開.
+* **Exact code length and alphabet were not stated** on any official IB page fetched this turn. Our server issues a **6-character** code from `23456789ABCDEFGHJKLMNPQRSTUVWXYZ`. Do not assume official codes are the same.
+
+**Room board (H):** free-text messages among members. The master can restrict who may use it. Players can hide a specified player's messages.
+
+**Records (mixed official wording, treat carefully):**
+
+* Official arcade online page: custom-match results **do not affect class** and “戦績も記録されません” (meaning the usual class / ranked record).
+* VS.Mobile has a **カスタムマッチ戦績** help page (“カスタムマッチでプレイした対戦戦績が閲覧できます”).
+* Blog (M, citing official paid/free table and records help): unit proficiency **is** recorded; a paid-only custom-match record page covers the last 30 days; general battle history, point / suit-usage rankings, suit-vs-suit and tag records are **not**. Official help does not say whether win rate / class / grade move. IB wiki (L): player level is affected; class/grade and player badge are not; per-mode totals and per-battle history are available for custom.
+
+---
+
+## 3. Private-room creation options (IB)
+
+There is **no free-text room name** on the official create form (not in official help, not in the blog's field list, not in the 2026-11-03 screenshot). Rooms are identified by invite code, settings, and search listing.
+
+Field list from official create help (H) plus the author's create-room screen on 2026-11-03 (M). Screenshot (H of the visible top of the form) confirms the schedule block and the monthly counter.
+
+| Official option | Allowed values (IB) | Conf. | Notes |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| Monthly create budget | 15 / month, paid only; reset 1st 00:00; dismiss does not refund | H / M | Shown as “今月はあと**15**回ルーム作成ができます。” |
+| 開催日 | Today through **14 days** ahead | M | Screenshot: `2026/11/3(火)` dropdown |
+| 開始時刻 | **07:00–22:xx**, **10-minute** steps; times earlier than now cannot be chosen | M / H of the footnote | Screenshot: hour `22` + minute `00`, footnote “※現在より前の時間は設定できません。” “22時台” means the 22:00 hour; the last minute value was not shown |
+| 開催時間 (valid duration from start) | **1 hour / 3 hours / 5 hours** | H | Screenshot default visible: `1時間`. Not an open-ended “until reset” |
+| 承認設定 | 承認なし / 承認あり | H | あり = master must accept the join |
+| 出撃形式 | ソロ出撃 / チーム出撃 / **ミックス出撃** | H | Mix is an IB addition (not on the XB official page) |
+| 参加人数 (max) | **4 / 8 / 16 / 32 / 64** | H | Minimum to actually custom-match is still 4 (matching help). 64 is IB; XB official listed 4/8/16/32 only |
+| 参加制限 勝率 | “以上” and “以下”, **5% steps** | M (steps) / H (exists) | Official help: judged with the room's sortie type; **mix uses the higher of solo/team**. Master must themselves satisfy the limits they set. Checked at create and at join; later stat changes do not kick anyone |
+| 参加制限 クラス | “以上” and “以下”, Pilot through Extreme | M / H | Same enforcement rules as win rate |
