+The rest of the form (approval, mode, size, limits, fes, rematch, comment, unit rule) is below the crop; the blog transcribed those fields from the same screen but did not publish the lower portion.
+
+Eyecatch of the official help index shows entries: パブリックルーム, ルーム作成, **機体プリセット設定**, **ルーム解散**.
+
+### XB official Private Match (historical differences)
+
+From the official XB arcade private-match page (indexed text; live 404 this turn):
+
+* Sortie: solo or team only (no mix).
+* Max players: 4 / 8 / 16 / 32 (no 64).
+* Comment was called **ルームポリシー**, with **five** values: 気軽に対戦 / 真剣勝負 / 初級者向け / 中級者向け / 上級者向け. Note **気軽** (XB) vs IB help example **気楽に対戦**.
+* Win rate used **総合戦績**; restriction was 勝率 and 階級 — grade was not listed.
+* Monthly create reset at **04:00** on the 1st (IB help says **00:00**).
+* Already in a room: cannot create or join another (XB). IB join help snippet fetched this turn did not repeat that sentence — **uncertain** whether IB still enforces one room at a time.
+* Access-code login cannot use private match (XB).
+* After a private-match bout, a dedicated result presentation plays; rematch can be enabled/disabled.
+* Already-in-a-room and “cannot create while already joined” are useful design notes but need an IB confirmation.
+
+---
+
+## 4. Comment presets (11) — incomplete
+
+Official IB create help (H) only gives examples, not the full list or IDs:
+
+* 気楽に対戦
+* 初心者限定
+
+The 2026-11-03 create-room screen (M) is “11 kinds”, and the blog quotes three more examples:
+
+* 誰でも歓迎
+* 初心者同士楽しもう
+* 機体練習
+
+That is **five distinct strings**, IDs unknown. The other six texts were not published in any official page, guide, wiki, or screenshot found this turn. The LM string table keys `CUSTOM_MTCH_MSG_1..11` (see `CUSTOM_ROOM_OPTIONS.md`) are the right place to finish the list; they were **not** extracted in this research pass.
+
+Do **not** reuse the five XB ルームポリシー strings as if they were the IB 11. Some may have been kept or reworded (気楽 vs 気軽), but that is unproven.
+
+Our web UI currently labels these “Preset message {n}” / “定型メッセージ {n}” (`rooms_comment_n`).
+
+---
+
+## 5. Mapping table (VS.Mobile → our field)
+
+Status: **match** = same meaning and comparable values; **mismatch** = we have the concept but different values, labels, or enforcement; **missing** = official has it, we do not; **extra** = we have it, official create form does not.
+
