index 6a9b100..549b67d 100644
--- a/CUSTOM_ROOMS.md
+++ b/CUSTOM_ROOMS.md
@@ -120,3 +120,15 @@ LoadRoom response callback: `0x1408e7970` (thunk `0x1408e8550`). WaitResponse: `
   call, old-matchmaker 404) and two card servers sharing one registry (same room id → same matchmaker key).
 * `server-sketch/loadtest/custom_room_e2e.py` (exvs2-lobbies repo): real server, fake cards, strict proto2 parse with
   the exe schema; 15/15 in-process, 15/15 with the registry on a separate matchmaker, plus registry-down fallback.
+
+
+## Web pick for the cab (auto-select)
+
+Making or joining a room on the Rooms page also picks it for the card's cab, the same as RegisterRoom on the LM
+(`CustomRooms.WebSelectsRoom`, default `true`). After that, re-touch the card on the cab and choose Custom Match;
+the LM step is optional. With several rooms, press **Use this room** (`POST ui/rooms/select`). The last pick wins,
+whether it came from the web or the LM. Leaving or closing the picked room clears the pick. A scheduled room counts
+as picked only once it opens.
+
+This uses the registry's existing `POST /tag/rooms/register` call, so a shared registry (LA) running 00b2619 or
+later needs no update.
