From edd381b89e9117ddff2b6d6e3f22715ca61874a3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ServerOmega <69215510+ServerOmega@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 12:23:05 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] Matchmaker: custom rooms with a 1on1 fes rule pair two
 solos as 1v1 (no CPU)

The cab only sends the room id (attr2), so the matchmaker reads the room's fes
rule from its registry. Fes 10-14 / 20-24 rooms are matched like the Fes 1on1
world (2 humans, one per side, no CPU seats, no NOCPU hold). Dual Select and
the other rules stay 2v2. Adds CustomRoomStore.GetById and
CustomRoomLimits.IsOneOnOneFes; lookup errors fall back to normal rules.

Co-authored-by: Grok Bot <grok-bot@users.noreply.github.com>
